{{!
    @template local_catquizlab/processmodel

    What happens, in what order, and what makes it happen.

    The interface shows a queue, a task, a worker and a run without saying how
    they follow from one another. This is that chain, said once, folded away
    until somebody wants it.

    Classes required for JS: none.
    Data attributes required for JS: none.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * stages - number, label, produces, automatic, manual, here
    * step - which of the four process steps the reader is on

    Example context (json):
    {
        "step": "plan",
        "stages": [
            {
                "id": "define",
                "number": 1,
                "label": "Define the experiment",
                "produces": "A stored definition. No test runs yet.",
                "automatic": false,
                "manual": true,
                "here": true
            }
        ]
    }
}}
<details class="mb-3">
    <summary class="text-muted small">{{#str}}flow:show, local_catquizlab{{/str}}</summary>
    <div class="card mt-2">
        <div class="card-body">
            <h3 class="h6">{{#str}}flow:heading, local_catquizlab{{/str}}</h3>
            <p class="small text-muted">{{#str}}flow:intro, local_catquizlab{{/str}}</p>
            <ol class="small mb-0">
                {{#stages}}
                    <li class="mb-2 {{#here}}font-weight-bold{{/here}}">
                        {{label}}
                        {{#automatic}}
                            <span class="badge badge-light">{{#str}}flow:automatic, local_catquizlab{{/str}}</span>
                        {{/automatic}}
                        {{#manual}}
                            <span class="badge badge-light">{{#str}}flow:manual, local_catquizlab{{/str}}</span>
                        {{/manual}}
                        {{#here}}
                            <span class="badge badge-primary">{{#str}}flow:herenow, local_catquizlab{{/str}}</span>
                        {{/here}}
                        <div class="text-muted font-weight-normal">{{produces}}</div>
                    </li>
                {{/stages}}
            </ol>
        </div>
    </div>
</details>
